    {
      "id": 43,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -560,
        130
      ],
      "size": [
        600,
        1180
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 24,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Note: H3 in 2K",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 text to video in 2K (Open-H3-Regenerate-2K)\n\nThree stages, left to right:\n\n1. **Draft.** MiniMax H3 (fl2va) with the 4-step turbo LoRA makes a 1344x768 clip of 124 frames (about 5 s at 24 fps), picture and sound together. 768p is what the refiner was trained on.\n2. **Upscale.** ComfyUI's own H3 latent upscaler (NVIDIA's 3D-conv model) takes the draft's latent to the chosen size, 1920x1088 or 2560x1440, and keeps the audio stream.\n3. **Refine.** The H3 **ref2va** model, patched by NVIDIA's Open-H3-Regenerate-2K weights (the one custom node, below), redraws the detail in 3 Euler steps starting from sigma 0.909. The audio is locked, so the sound is the draft's.\n\n**Sharp curve is off on purpose:** all 50 `curve_B` tensors in `sharp_curve_branches.safetensors` are zero, so it adds nothing; the merged 2K weights already carry NVIDIA's LMS Sharp adapter.\n\nMeasured on an RTX 5090 32 GB (2026-11-09): **1920x1088 about 6 min, 2560x1440 about 12.5 min** for one clip; either size fills the card's memory.\n\n## Node pack\n\n- [1038lab/ComfyUI-Open-H3-Regenerate-2K](https://github.com/1038lab/ComfyUI-Open-H3-Regenerate-2K) (GPL-3.0), tested at commit 5552c70. One node, `Open-H3 Regenerate 2K`. It downloads its weights into `models/loras/minmax/` when they are missing.\n\n## Model links\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n- [minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n- [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)\n\n**loras**\n\n- [minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_4step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/loras/minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_4step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_bf16.safetensors)\n- [open_h3_regenerate_2k_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/1038lab/Open-H3-Regenerate-2K/resolve/main/lora/open_h3_regenerate_2k_bf16.safetensors) (8.8 GB, into `loras/minmax/`; the node looks anywhere under `loras/`)\n\n**latent_upscale_models**\n\n- [minimax_h3_latent_upscaler_3d_conv_v1_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/1038lab/Open-H3-Regenerate-2K/resolve/main/latent_upscale_models/minimax_h3_latent_upscaler_3d_conv_v1_bf16.safetensors) (byte-identical to NVIDIA's `latent_upsampler/` copy)\n\nSources: [NVIDIA Open-H3-Regenerate-2K](https://huggingface.co/Efficient-Large-Model/Open-H3-Regenerate-2K), [project page](https://nvlabs.github.io/Sana/Open-H3-Regenerate-2K/).\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
